            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Lúa Đại Việt - Bui Vien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Bui Vien\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam136 contributions\n0\nHigh-end seafood restaurant in Ho Chi Minh City walking street\nSep 2026 • Friends\nHigh-end seafood restaurant open all day and night in Ho Chi Minh City Walking Street, come here for lobster, Ca Mau crab, queen snails, iron shrimp... delicious and fresh, refueling energy, going to bar 2 is fine.\n\nThe restaurant is open 24/7, so after going out, you can have warm shrimp porridge to warm up and sleep well, and they also have a hotel and sell tours. Large restaurant and hotel chain - where are the 7-9 storefronts on Bui Vien walking street?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 9, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
