            "review_text": "han h\n5 contributions\n0\nDai Viet Rural Restaurant - Vietnamese restaurant, delicious seafood Bui Vien 131\nOct 2023 • Friends\nDai Viet Rural Restaurant has clearly listed prices, a countryside space in the heart of Western Bui Vien street. Decorated with gourds and lotus flowers, the staff wears ao dai, the overall space is rich in Vietnamese identity.\n\nSurprising because the menu is rich with more than 300 dishes, from Vietnamese to European dishes. The lake contains crabs, lobsters, large snails, and large fish right next to the dining table. We ordered cheese lobster because we heard that this dish is a best-seller, accompanied by 2 Phan Thiet blue crabs with the restaurant's signature sauce. Great food, lovely staff.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten October 29, 2023",
