            "review_text": "ZaiTri\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam603 contributions\n0\nThe Rice Hotel Restaurant - Dai Viet Rural Restaurant in the middle of Bui Vien western street\nOct 2023 • Family\nThis is The Rice Hotel - Restaurant located in the middle of Bui Vien walking street, District 1, where people flock to have fun every night, with a variety of cuisine, bustling sounds, dancers in surrounding bars and other artists. beautiful dance performance\n\nThe Rice Restaurant is both a restaurant and a hotel with 5-6 floors with a large frontage, a 24/24 breakfast spot on Bui Vien walking street, with outside seating space, and a humid mezzanine. Vietnamese dishes, European and Asian dishes, Italian, Mexican or seafood are also the restaurant's strengths\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten October 12, 2023",
